IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. COPYBOOK-DEMO.
       AUTHOR. VALIDATION-PLATFORM.

       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       COPY COMMON.

       01  WS-RESULT           PIC 9(8) VALUE 0.
       01  WS-COUNTER          PIC 9(4) VALUE 0.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN-LOGIC.
           DISPLAY "COPYBOOK DEMO STARTED".

           MOVE 100 TO CLAIM-AMOUNT.
           MOVE "C-999" TO CLAIM-ID.
           DISPLAY "INITIAL CLAIM-ID=" CLAIM-ID.
           DISPLAY "INITIAL CLAIM-AMOUNT=" CLAIM-AMOUNT.

           MOVE CLAIM-AMOUNT TO WS-RESULT.
           DISPLAY "WS-RESULT=" WS-RESULT.

           IF CLAIM-AMOUNT > 500
               DISPLAY "AMOUNT GT 500"
           ELSE
               DISPLAY "AMOUNT LE 500"
           END-IF.

           DISPLAY "FINAL CLAIM-ID=" CLAIM-ID.
           DISPLAY "FINAL CLAIM-AMOUNT=" CLAIM-AMOUNT.

           STOP RUN.